.SH NAME
git-bug-pr-diff - Display the diff of a pull request


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit-bug pr diff PR_ID [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Display the changes from the merge base of the target branch and the head, to the head, in unified format.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for diff


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgit-bug-pr(1)\fP
